cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this casebook in your research, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Dual-Use Ambiguity Casebook: 36 Structured Cases at the AI-Era Biology Decision Boundary"
abstract: >
  A structured casebook of 36 biology cases at the dual-use decision boundary,
  covering query-level decisions a frontier language model must make when a
  researcher asks about potentially dangerous biology. Each case uses a fixed
  12-field template adapted from the NSABB DURC framework, extended to the
  AI-query context. Includes systematic multi-model evaluation results
  (Claude Sonnet 4.6, Claude Opus 4.7, GPT-4o, Gemini 2.5 Pro).
authors:
